WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.680
- I like to swing right out of that tune

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.380
and jump right in to the next one,

00:00:05.276 --> 00:00:06.743
a song I wrote myself,

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.903
mostly here and partially
in the United States, too.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:18.545
(guitar playing begins)

00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:36.935
♪ Just yesterday morning they
let me know you were gone ♪

00:00:38.817 --> 00:00:43.817
♪ Suzanne, the plans they
made put an end to you ♪

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:49.917
♪ I walked out on the morning
and I wrote down this song ♪

00:00:51.687 --> 00:00:56.687
♪ I just can't remember
who to send it to ♪

00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:03.317
♪ I've seen fire and I've seen rain ♪

00:01:03.527 --> 00:01:08.527
♪ I've seen sunny days that
I thought would never end ♪

00:01:10.007 --> 00:01:15.007
♪ I've seen lonely times when
I could not find a friend ♪

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:21.567
♪ But I always thought
that I'd see you again ♪

00:01:26.737 --> 00:01:29.877
♪ Won't you look down upon me, Jesus ♪

00:01:29.877 --> 00:01:34.357
♪ You've got to help me make a stand ♪

00:01:34.357 --> 00:01:39.357
♪ You've just got to see
me through another day ♪

00:01:40.497 --> 00:01:45.497
♪ My body's aching and
my time is at hand ♪

00:01:47.177 --> 00:01:52.177
♪ And I won't make it any other way ♪

00:01:53.677 --> 00:01:58.677
♪ I've seen fire and I've seen rain ♪

00:01:58.907 --> 00:02:03.907
♪ I've seen sunny days that
I thought would never end ♪

00:02:05.347 --> 00:02:10.347
♪ I've seen lonely times when
I could not find a friend ♪

00:02:11.977 --> 00:02:16.977
♪ But I always thought
that I'd see you again ♪

00:02:22.017 --> 00:02:25.097
♪ I've been walking my
mind to an easy time ♪

00:02:25.097 --> 00:02:29.417
♪ With my back turned towards the sun ♪

00:02:29.417 --> 00:02:31.817
♪ Lord knows when the cold wind blows ♪

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:35.337
♪ It'll turn your head around, now ♪

00:02:35.337 --> 00:02:38.747
♪ There's hours of time
on the telephone line ♪

00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:42.457
♪ To talk about things to come ♪

00:02:42.457 --> 00:02:47.457
♪ Sweet dreams and flying
machines in pieces on the ground ♪

00:02:48.559 --> 00:02:53.559
♪ Whoa now, I've seen
fire and I've seen rain ♪

00:02:54.557 --> 00:02:59.557
♪ I've seen sunny days that
I thought would never end ♪

00:03:01.007 --> 00:03:06.007
♪ I've seen lonely times when
I could not find a friend ♪

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:09.995
♪ But I always thought that I'd see you, ♪

00:03:09.995 --> 00:03:14.995
♪ Somehow, one more time again, now ♪

00:03:17.147 --> 00:03:22.147
♪ I thought I'd see you
one more time again ♪

00:03:23.727 --> 00:03:28.727
♪ There's just a few things
coming my way this time around ♪

00:03:29.577 --> 00:03:32.257
♪ Whoa now, I thought I'd see you, ♪

00:03:32.257 --> 00:03:35.871
♪ I thought I'd see you, fire and rain ♪

00:03:35.871 --> 00:03:40.871
♪ La, la, la, la, la, la,
la, la, la, la, la, la ♪

00:03:42.771 --> 00:03:45.771
